worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_translation_recall_and_compound_interest.js"
  ceiling 1231
  rationale "Compositional and Wiktionary translation, brainstorming, fact and coreference lookup, name and message recall, memory writes and the compound-interest answers. Issue #658 cut this module out of one oversized worker file by line count; R1188-U5 named it after what it holds. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling moved 1466 to 1471 for issue #1173 R3 (2026-10-07): the year-count reader no longer stops at the "year" of "compounded yearly", and the CSV-to-JSON request gets its reader, so probes p069 and p119 reach their handlers in both runtimes. Ceiling moved to 1474 for issue #1175 R3 (follow-up round, 2026-10-08): the brainstorm, roleplay, previous-message recall and translation arms record their named refusal events when they answer without their input, and the translation answer now carries its evidence. Lowered to 1465 for issue #918 (2026-10-08): tryKupiSlona answers through the kupi_slona rule of data/seed/handler-rules.lino instead of an inline Russian text. Lowered to 1454 the same day: the brainstorm count policy is the seed default_count and count_cardinal, and the roleplay fallbacks are the seed alone. Ceiling moved to 1460 the same day: tryFactLookup renders a release-timeline record against today instead of reading a summary the record does not carry. Lowered to 1415 the same day: tryCompoundInterest reads its periods, labels, default rates and final-amount marker from the policy compound_interest block of data/seed/handler-rules.lino and its wording from seeded responses, as the native handler does. Ceiling moved 1415 to 1431 for issue #918 (MIGRATE4, 2026-10-08): the coreference twin resolves the nearest earlier user turn naming an antecedent (nearestCoreferenceAntecedent, which the coreference_antecedent claim evidence reads too) and answers the antecedent seeded body when no seeded fact answers, as rust/src/solver_handlers/benchmark_prompts.rs try_coreference_request does. Ceiling moved 1431 to 1434 (R1188-U5): the first comment lines say what the module holds. Ceiling moved 1434 to 1438 for R1188-U19 (2026-10-09): the Wiktionary reader returns every offered target surface (extractWiktionaryCandidates) so the chat route chooses among them by the round trip."
